---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="CV" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    Cristian Ramon-Cortes Vilarrodona is a Senior Manager at Seqera with a PhD in Computer Sciences from the Technical
    University of Catalonia (UPC) and the Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC). He holds dual engineering degrees in
    Computer Science and Industrial Engineering, plus an MSc in High-Performance Computing. His research focused on
    programming models and frameworks for distributed HPC, Big Data, and Data Science workflows, contributing to
    COMPSs, PyCOMPSs, and AutoParallel. After six years at BSC, he joined Dynatrace where he progressed from Senior
    Software Engineer to Team Lead before moving to Seqera in 2024, where he leads engineering teams working on
    scientific workflow orchestration.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior Manager at Seqera"
      subtitle="Oct 2025 – Present | Seqera, Remote"
    >
      Leading engineering management across multiple teams focused on scientific workflow orchestration and cloud-native bioinformatics infrastructure.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Technical Lead at Seqera"
      subtitle="Feb 2025 – Oct 2025 | Seqera, Remote"
    >
      Served as technical lead driving architecture decisions and cross-team alignment for Seqera's core platform.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior Software Engineer at Seqera"
      subtitle="Nov 2024 – Feb 2025 | Seqera, Remote"
    >
      Contributed as a senior engineer to Seqera's workflow management platform, working on scalability and reliability improvements.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Team Lead at Dynatrace"
      subtitle="Jun 2022 – Nov 2024 | Dynatrace, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Led an engineering team building next-generation storage and analytics for behavioural data at scale, combining people management with hands-on product delivery.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior Software Engineer at Dynatrace"
      subtitle="Oct 2020 – Jun 2022 | Dynatrace, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Developed high-performance storage and processing solutions for behavioural analytics in observability infrastructure. Promoted to Team Lead within two years.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Engineer (PhD Student) at BSC"
      subtitle="May 2017 – Oct 2020 | Barcelona Supercomputing Center, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Received a Spanish Ministry PhD grant to work in the Workflows and Distributed Computing (WDC) group. Contributed to COMPSs, PyCOMPSs, and developed the AutoParallel module and the Distributed Stream Library as part of his doctoral research.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Junior Developer at BSC"
      subtitle="Feb 2016 – May 2017 | Barcelona Supercomputing Center, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Developed and maintained features for the COMPSs and PyCOMPSs frameworks within the Workflows and Distributed Computing group.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Resident Student at BSC"
      subtitle="Apr 2014 – Feb 2016 | Barcelona Supercomputing Center, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Joined BSC as a Resident Student for the Grid Computing group, gaining hands-on experience with distributed computing platforms and scientific software.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Teacher at Academia SOL"
      subtitle="Sep 2011 – Dec 2013 | Academia SOL, Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Taught mathematics, physics, and science subjects to secondary and high-school students in a study consultancy.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="PhD in Computer Sciences"
      subtitle="2017 – 2020 | Computer Architecture Department (DAC/UPC) & Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC), Barcelona, Spain"
    >
      Thesis: "Programming Models to support Data Science Workflows". Grade: Excellent Cum Laude. Supervised by Rosa M. Badia and Jorge Ejarque.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="MSc in Innovation and Research in Informatics — High Performance Computing (MIRI-HPC)"
      subtitle="2015 – 2017 | Polytechnical University of Catalonia (UPC), Barcelona, Spain"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Dual BSc. Diploma"
      subtitle="2008 – 2014 | Centre de Formació Interdisciplinaria Superior (CFIS/UPC), Barcelona, Spain"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Engineering Degree in Computer Science (BSc. and MSc.)"
      subtitle="2008 – 2014 | Facultat d'Informatica de Barcelona (FIB/UPC), Barcelona, Spain"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Engineering Degree in Industrial Engineering (BSc. and MSc.)"
      subtitle="2008 – 2014 | Escola Tecnica Superior d'Enginyeria Industrial de Barcelona (ETSEIB/UPC), Barcelona, Spain"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6 mb-10">
    <li>Java</li>
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>Kotlin</li>
    <li>Groovy</li>
    <li>Angular</li>
    <li>React</li>
    <li>Bash</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>Kubernetes</li>
    <li>Helm</li>
    <li>ArgoCD</li>
    <li>Git</li>
    <li>JIRA</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
